OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,6,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores Henry
OL,7,     FPurcell's childhood in London - at
OL,8,     Fthe time a city in turmoil - and
OL,9,     FPurcell's youth as a chorister in
OL,10,     Fthe Chapel Royal.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie welcomes composer Shirley J.
OL,13,     FThompson and The London Tango
OL,14,     FQuintet to In Tune.
OL,15,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,16,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Ffavourites, including works by
OL,19,     FJacques Offenbach, George Gershwin
OL,20,     Fand Mel Bonis.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
